mincia ad allenarsi per completare un Ironman, nonostante le difficoltà fisiche e lo scetticismo che lo circondano. Ispirato a una storia vera.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Rendirse no es una opción","language":"es-ES"},"releaseDate":"2016-11-04","status":"Released","rating":7.4,"ratingCount":313,"genres":["Commedia","Dramma","Avventura"],"countries":["Spain","Portugal"],"facts":{"Runtime":"108m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1271600,"name":"Dani Rovira","role":"Ramón","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pC332VwrQi1hzsVKV5Jr8r7mLB.jpg"},{"id":114460,"name":"Alexandra Jiménez","role":"Inma","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2dRN4aqsNgO9Um2f3FUWSx5WMcx.jpg"},{"id":24977,"name":"Karra Elejalde","role":"Manolo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kHODqgc2c7RaZz9Sp7cedgadvzG.jpg"},{"id":2319,"name":"Maria de Medeiros","role":"Noelia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v53G55qSYaVRvbgUZ2uch4gVHT6.jpg"},{"id":1149067,"name":"David Verdaguer","role":"Mario","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6TreWuZXVK9qYoHC0qLSbnHA1e0.jpg"},{"id":1455959,"name":"Andrea Trepat","role":"Becaria Lili","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qTPfRTjbjdfdnCgkchdhyjkvkZ3.jpg"},{"id":1020808,"name":"Bruno Bergonzini","role":"Bernat"},{"id":33410,"name":"Clara Segura","role":"Dra. Berta","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AiDKfpPlgdiu7HHNwKkrDmr7h9O.jpg"},{"id":1121031,"name":"Andrés Velencoso","role":"Monitor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gzQlzEWYWDNDfAEH2pk8VR30xDe.jpg"},{"id":107920,"name":"Ricardo Pereira","role":"Marcos","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ka35HapmYDkf1GSzmcDcl3YWEQa.jpg"},{"id":116598,"name":"Manuela Couto","role":"Jefa de Ramón","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7uaTeY5wSxGgCEkPCJWKEGoZFNa.jpg"},{"id":1042729,"name":"Alba Ribas","role":"Ariadna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfASs4kqXPL7CmRWmqjJovwjfsu.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Dopo una diagnosi di sclerosi multipla, Ramón Arroyo decide di non arrendersi e comincia ad allenarsi per completare un Ironman, nonostante le difficoltà fisiche e lo scetticismo che lo circondano. Ispirato a una storia vera."},{"language":"en-US","title":"100 Meters","overview":"Based on the incredibly true story of a Spanish man with Multiple Sclerosis who tried to finish an Iron-Man: 3,8km swimming, 180km cycling and 42 running. And he was told that he could not make 100 meters."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Ramón Arroyo es un empresario de éxito y un padre de familia que quisiera pasar más tiempo con su mujer e hijo. Cuando su suegro, viudo y amargado, se instala en su casa, él empieza a usar el trabajo como válvula de escape. Pero entonces es diagnosticado con esclerosis múltiple y pronto no podrá caminar ni 100 metros. Ramón intenta ignorar la realidad, y acaba asilándose del mundo… Hasta el nacimiento de su segundo hijo. Con la llegada del pequeño se propone seguir luchando y por eso toma la decisión de acabar la prueba atlética más dura del mundo: el ironman.","tagline":"Rendirse no es una opción"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mt9qqJGEreDI7cr4JYmDQY4qmkI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mt9qqJGEreDI7cr4JYmDQY4qmkI.png","language":"es","width":1280,"height":191}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3tSFaWi4CGnwBMYD429ocKVeoIM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3tSFaWi4CGnwBMYD429ocKVeoIM.jpg","language":"es","width":1280,"height":1920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6bqmYq7Pz3cW1h7qrqijNAjLIUl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6bqmYq7Pz3cW1h7qrqijNAjLIUl.jpg","language":"es","width":1138,"height":1707},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t8MOY34pZoJNS